# AI Mentor — Infrastructure Context

## Stack

- **Backend**: Python 3.11, FastAPI, Celery, SQLAlchemy (async), pgvector
- **Frontend**: React 19, Vite, TypeScript, nginx on host (production)
- **DB**: PostgreSQL 16 (pgvector), Redis 7
- **Storage**: MinIO (S3-compatible)
- **LLM**: Gemini 2.5 Pro (chat) + Gemini 2.5 Flash (auxiliary) via OpenAI-compatible API
- **Monitoring**: Loki + Promtail + Grafana + Prometheus + Node Exporter + cAdvisor

## Docker

Backend services run in Docker. Nginx runs on the **host** (systemd), not in Docker.

- `docker-compose.yml` — production stack (postgres, redis, minio, api, worker, beat, loki, promtail, grafana, prometheus, node-exporter, cadvisor)
- `docker-compose.dev.yml` — dev (postgres only)
- `backend/Dockerfile` — Python 3.11-slim, uvicorn
- `frontend/Dockerfile` — multi-stage: node:20-alpine build (used to compile static files)
- `nginx/ai-mentor.conf` — host Nginx config: reverse proxy /api/ to localhost:8000, SPA fallback, SSE, TUS, maintenance mode

### Docker services

| Service  | Port | Image               | Notes |
|----------|------|---------------------|-------|
| api      | 8000 | ai-mentor-backend      | builds the shared backend image |
| worker   | -    | ai-mentor-backend      | no build, reuses api image |
| beat     | -    | ai-mentor-backend      | no build, reuses api image |
| postgres | 5432 | pgvector/pgvector:pg16 | |
| redis    | 6379 | redis:7-alpine      | |
| minio    | 9000/9001 | minio/minio    | |
| grafana  | 3000 | grafana/grafana     | |
| prometheus | 9090 | prom/prometheus  | |
| node-exporter | - | prom/node-exporter | host metrics |
| cadvisor | - | gcr.io/cadvisor/cadvisor | container metrics |

### Host services (systemd)

| Service | Port | Notes |
|---------|------|-------|
| nginx   | 80, 443 | Reverse proxy, TLS termination |

### Common commands

- Rebuild frontend: `docker build --target build -t ai-mentor-frontend-build ./frontend && docker run --rm -v /var/www/ai-mentor:/out ai-mentor-frontend-build sh -c 'cp -r /app/dist/* /out/'`
- Rebuild & restart backend: `docker compose build api && docker compose up -d api worker beat`
- Reload Nginx: `nginx -t && nginx -s reload`
- Full stack up: `docker compose up -d`
- Logs: `docker compose logs -f <service>`

### Build rules

- **NEVER** use `--no-cache` unless requirements.txt or Dockerfile changed. Cached layers save disk and time.
- Use `--no-cache` only when dependencies (requirements.txt, package.json) or Dockerfile itself changed.
- Periodically run `docker system prune -f` to clean dangling images.

## Documentation language

- All project documentation (README.md, architecture/*.md, code comments) must be written in **English only**.
- The only exception is UI localization files (`frontend/src/locales/ru.json`).
- Prompt templates in `backend/app/chat/prompts/` must use English for `<instructions>`. The `<classifier_hint>` may include example queries in both RU and EN.

## Frontend assets

- Static assets in `frontend/public/` (logos, favicon)
- Theme switching via `[data-theme="dark"]` on `<html>`
- No `src/assets/` directory — all static files in `public/`
- No path aliases in tsconfig or vite config
